                                                "sense_id": "41633a90-2d3c-3865-8416-c3d92efc1b64",
                                                "text": "Google has racked up some 2 undecillion rubles ($2.5 decillion) worth of fines in Russia after years of refusing to restore the accounts of pro-Kremlin and state-run media outlets, the RBC news website reported Tuesday, citing an anonymous source familiar with court rulings against the tech company."
